flowchart TD
    A[Weak combined signal] --> B[Linear score z stays low]
    B --> C[Activation nearly cuts it]
    C --> D[Little signal reaches next layer]

    E[Borderline combined signal] --> F[Linear score z barely rises]
    F --> G[Activation leaves a small positive]
    G --> H[Weak signal barely survives]

    I[Strong combined signal] --> J[Linear score z rises clearly]
    J --> K[Activation keeps it active]
    K --> L[Strong signal reaches next layer]
